id: binding-volley
name: Binding Volley
advancement: true
prerequisite: Force or Magic Score 10+
tpCost: 10
# "You may double the amount of Ki Points you spend to reduce the target's Life Points by your full Might value" - 4(T)
# KP for the whole Might, offered beside the 2(T) for half.
squeezeDouble: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  4(T) KP in place of 2(T): the whole of your Might off their Life Points.
text: >
  Binding Volley: You can trap your target in a stronger form of binding, causing more damage!
  –Prerequisites: Force or Magic Score 10+
  –TP Cost: 10
  –Effect: You may double the amount of Ki Points you spend to reduce the target’s Life Points by your full Might value
  through the effects of Binding.
